comment13.params=open
comment13.target=void setDrs(boolean)
comment13.text=\n Opens or closes the DRS flap\: opened, its rear edge lifts up.\n
comment14.params=on
comment14.target=void setBraking(boolean)
comment15.params=on
comment15.target=void updateSparks(boolean)
comment15.text=\n Random sparks fly from the floor of the car.\n
comment16.params=power
comment16.target=void updateSmoke(double)
comment16.text=\n Puffs of smoke behind the rear tyres.\n\n @param power 0 hides the smoke, 1 is the biggest cloud\n
comment2.target=FormulaOne()
comment2.text=\n Creates a random team car.\n
comment3.params=startX startY
comment3.target=FormulaOne(int, int)
comment3.text=\n Spawns a random team car with a set start position.\n
comment4.target=java.lang.String randomTeamColor()
comment5.target=int getRaceNumber()
comment6.params=dx dy
comment6.target=void fahren(int, int)
comment6.text=\n Drives with a full show\: the car accelerates and brakes smoothly,\n the wheels spin up with the speed, the suspension bounces, smoke rises\n from the rear tyres at launch, the DRS flap opens on long straights,\n sparks fly from the floor at speed, and the brake light and the brake\n discs glow while slowing down.\n
comment7.params=frames
comment7.target=void burnout(int)
comment7.text=\n Revs the engine on the spot\: the wheels spin at full speed,\n the car shakes and the rear tyres smoke.\n\n @param frames the length of the burnout (one frame is ~15 ms)\n
comment8.target=void startSequenz()
comment8.text=\n The race start\: five red lights switch on one after another,\n then they go out and the car launches with a burnout.\n
comment9.params=centerX centerY radius rimRadius compound
comment9.target=void addTyre(int, int, int, int, java.lang.String)
comment9.text=\n Layers a tyre\: black base, colored compound ring, black rubber and a silver rim.\n
